{"postPage":{"id":"1328ef3f-276b-47d5-bcc9-b242a7c07532","post":{"id":"1328ef3f-276b-47d5-bcc9-b242a7c07532","title":"A Life in Balance","excerpt":"Hello, yes, it's been awhile...\"Life happens.\" they say. Who are \"they\" anyway? The day before my last posting a very dear friend died....","firstPublishedDate":"2017-07-25T19:10:54.039Z","lastPublishedDate":"2017-07-25T19:10:54.039Z","url":{"base":"https://www.theglasspantry.com","path":"/single-post/2017/07/25/a-life-in-balance"},"slug":"2017/07/25/a-life-in-balance","featured":false,"pinned":false,"categoryIds":["340a691e-f0fb-48cb-81ca-aa54a6c4e6bc","15abe877-7a05-4ea7-9f92-bfe7c73120b4","f0e3fce4-d677-461b-af98-d7f059887e9a","accdf66c-0e8c-4ccb-9d3c-46a7d67e90f5","715d4ad1-bef8-425f-aa2b-a2ef47bf20ca","86cb13c9-ebe8-4da9-92bc-d9f63db5b610","6817d7b7-5a3c-46cb-84df-6c98e5d3e96f","91a7e390-df71-4f96-9111-d518514de53a","7b640cc9-cc3a-4e7a-854c-b3ddf807d97e","6ba8db7a-6fe2-4b5a-83bf-acd0b1cbda4c"],"memberId":"2d3dcba5-39de-4c33-b11a-89d9248a0e51","hashtags":[],"commentingEnabled":true,"postCountInfo":{"comments":0,"likes":0,"views":32},"minutesToRead":6,"tagIds":["6e9de5dd-e7c4-49e8-b7b7-fa3043f60857","b737645e-e928-43dd-944f-a2375a332a1f","189deafd-d9db-410e-a88d-618d5f25bc0a","5d9239d1-2d87-4018-989c-1d9077891496","d3b9b019-dd14-4f6a-9da2-0ebfcf6a3852"],"relatedPostIds":[],"pricingPlanIds":[],"language":"en","metrics":{"comments":0,"likes":0,"views":32,"totalRatings":0,"averageRating":0},"seoData":{"tags":[{"type":"title","children":"A Life in Balance","custom":false,"disabled":false},{"type":"meta","props":{"name":"description","content":"Salt Encrusted Fish Recipe | Twice Smoked Ham | The Glass Pantry"},"children":"","custom":false,"disabled":false}]},"richContent":{"nodes":[{"type":"PARAGRAPH","id":"8kc2j","nodes":[{"type":"TEXT","id":"","nodes":[],"textData":{"text":"Hello, yes, it's been awhile...\"Life happens.\" they say. ","decorations":[]}}],"paragraphData":{"textStyle":{"textAlignment":"AUTO"},"indentation":0}},{"type":"PARAGRAPH","id":"bhdm","nodes":[{"type":"TEXT","id":"","nodes":[],"textData":{"text":"Who are \"they\" anyway?","decorations":[]}}],"paragraphData":{"textStyle":{"textAlignment":"AUTO"},"indentation":0}},{"type":"PARAGRAPH","id":"aqruf","nodes":[{"type":"TEXT","id":"","nodes":[],"textData":{"text":" ","decorations":[]}}],"paragraphData":{"textStyle":{"textAlignment":"AUTO"},"indentation":0}},{"type":"IMAGE","id":"cu31v","nodes":[],"imageData":{"containerData":{"width":{"size":"CONTENT"},"alignment":"CENTER","textWrap":true},"image":{"src":{"id":"577c92_cdab3ded213a4fdda8870189e05949af~mv2.jpg"},"width":1301,"height":936},"altText":"My new cat \"Bud\""}},{"type":"PARAGRAPH","id":"5gih8","nodes":[{"type":"TEXT","id":"","nodes":[],"textData":{"text":" ","decorations":[]}}],"paragraphData":{"textStyle":{"textAlignment":"AUTO"},"indentation":0}},{"type":"PARAGRAPH","id":"9ip24","nodes":[{"type":"TEXT","id":"","nodes":[],"textData":{"text":"   The day before my last posting a very dear friend died. He lived across the street from us and was a large part of our family's life. This is his cat \"Bud\". He's ours now. He has acclimated very well to our 2 large dogs and super old cat \"Buddy\". Yes, they both have pretty much the same name. Fortunately they were already friends.","decorations":[]}}],"paragraphData":{"textStyle":{"textAlignment":"AUTO"},"indentation":0}},{"type":"PARAGRAPH","id":"apa3","nodes":[{"type":"TEXT","id":"","nodes":[],"textData":{"text":" ","decorations":[]}}],"paragraphData":{"textStyle":{"textAlignment":"AUTO"},"indentation":0}},{"type":"PARAGRAPH","id":"cjg6v","nodes":[{"type":"TEXT","id":"","nodes":[],"textData":{"text":"It's been difficult to find time or a way to process \"blogging\" the last few weeks.","decorations":[]}}],"paragraphData":{"textStyle":{"textAlignment":"AUTO"},"indentation":0}},{"type":"PARAGRAPH","id":"9b3mr","nodes":[{"type":"TEXT","id":"","nodes":[],"textData":{"text":" ","decorations":[]}}],"paragraphData":{"textStyle":{"textAlignment":"AUTO"},"indentation":0}},{"type":"PARAGRAPH","id":"an9t3","nodes":[{"type":"TEXT","id":"","nodes":[],"textData":{"text":"Life has been out of balance. ","decorations":[]}}],"paragraphData":{"textStyle":{"textAlignment":"AUTO"},"indentation":0}},{"type":"PARAGRAPH","id":"btdan","nodes":[{"type":"TEXT","id":"","nodes":[],"textData":{"text":" ","decorations":[]}}],"paragraphData":{"textStyle":{"textAlignment":"AUTO"},"indentation":0}},{"type":"PARAGRAPH","id":"a559v","nodes":[{"type":"TEXT","id":"","nodes":[],"textData":{"text":"It was a very unexpected death, although our friend had many real health problems like type 1 diabetes and rheumatoid arthritis. He was only 62 years old and he was very active. He was always visiting and helping around our house. It was amazing what that man could do! He took care of our animals when we were gone and when our kids still lived at home he watched over them from his house next door. Making sure they didn't throw outrageous parties while we were gone and that they were safely home after school each day. He was important in our lives and we appreciated him a lot.","decorations":[]}}],"paragraphData":{"textStyle":{"textAlignment":"AUTO"},"indentation":0}},{"type":"PARAGRAPH","id":"9oi95","nodes":[{"type":"TEXT","id":"","nodes":[],"textData":{"text":" ","decorations":[]}}],"paragraphData":{"textStyle":{"textAlignment":"AUTO"},"indentation":0}},{"type":"PARAGRAPH","id":"1pbna","nodes":[{"type":"TEXT","id":"","nodes":[],"textData":{"text":"My husband was particularly close to our friend and has taken on a lot of responsibility for the care of his estate since he passed. He's been working with our friends son who is young and needs advice and he's been caring for the yard and the property because the son lives far away. The \"all the way across the country\" kind of far away. This is not a complaint, just a statement of fact because as important as it is, and as happy as we are to do this for our friend, it does change our lives and we are missing him so much that everything feels a little harder and out of balance.","decorations":[]}}],"paragraphData":{"textStyle":{"textAlignment":"AUTO"},"indentation":0}},{"type":"PARAGRAPH","id":"br1li","nodes":[{"type":"TEXT","id":"","nodes":[],"textData":{"text":"\n","decorations":[]}},{"type":"TEXT","id":"","nodes":[],"textData":{"text":"It was my birthday a few days after his death. That felt out of balance.","decorations":[]}}],"paragraphData":{"textStyle":{"textAlignment":"AUTO"},"indentation":0}},{"type":"PARAGRAPH","id":"9bo83","nodes":[{"type":"TEXT","id":"","nodes":[],"textData":{"text":" ","decorations":[]}}],"paragraphData":{"textStyle":{"textAlignment":"AUTO"},"indentation":0}},{"type":"PARAGRAPH","id":"7gt7d","nodes":[{"type":"TEXT","id":"","nodes":[],"textData":{"text":"We did have a really lovely day, though. My husband took me to Portland, OR for some shopping at my favorite Asian Market ","decorations":[]}},{"type":"TEXT","id":"","nodes":[],"textData":{"text":"Fubonn ","decorations":[{"type":"BOLD","fontWeightValue":700},{"type":"COLOR","colorData":{"foreground":"#0957a2"}},{"type":"LINK","linkData":{"link":{"url":"www.fubonn.com/","target":"BLANK"}}}]}},{"type":"TEXT","id":"","nodes":[],"textData":{"text":"and a wonderful Sushi lunch in Gresham, OR called ","decorations":[]}}],"paragraphData":{"textStyle":{"textAlignment":"AUTO"},"indentation":0}},{"type":"PARAGRAPH","id":"5h5rj","nodes":[{"type":"TEXT","id":"","nodes":[],"textData":{"text":"Yami Sushi and Teriyaki.","decorations":[{"type":"BOLD","fontWeightValue":700},{"type":"COLOR","colorData":{"foreground":"#0957a2"}},{"type":"LINK","linkData":{"link":{"url":"www.yelp.com/biz/yami-sushi-and-teriyaki-gresham","target":"BLANK"}}}]}},{"type":"TEXT","id":"","nodes":[],"textData":{"text":" I found the Sushi place on Yelp when we were heading home from our shopping. Then I drove us home in my convertible VW EOS with the top down.","decorations":[{"type":"LINK","linkData":{"link":{"url":"www.yelp.com/biz/yami-sushi-and-teriyaki-gresham","target":"BLANK"}}}]}}],"paragraphData":{"textStyle":{"textAlignment":"AUTO"},"indentation":0}},{"type":"PARAGRAPH","id":"f77g","nodes":[{"type":"TEXT","id":"","nodes":[],"textData":{"text":" ","decorations":[]}}],"paragraphData":{"textStyle":{"textAlignment":"AUTO"},"indentation":0}},{"type":"PARAGRAPH","id":"7ib5u","nodes":[{"type":"TEXT","id":"","nodes":[],"textData":{"text":" ","decorations":[]}}],"paragraphData":{"textStyle":{"textAlignment":"AUTO"},"indentation":0}},{"type":"PARAGRAPH","id":"atrcr","nodes":[{"type":"TEXT","id":"","nodes":[],"textData":{"text":" I do love my car!","decorations":[{"type":"LINK","linkData":{"link":{"url":"www.yelp.com/biz/yami-sushi-and-teriyaki-gresham","target":"BLANK"}}}]}}],"paragraphData":{"textStyle":{"textAlignment":"AUTO"},"indentation":0}},{"type":"PARAGRAPH","id":"au5qc","nodes":[{"type":"TEXT","id":"","nodes":[],"textData":{"text":" ","decorations":[]}}],"paragraphData":{"textStyle":{"textAlignment":"AUTO"},"indentation":0}},{"type":"PARAGRAPH","id":"e66jn","nodes":[{"type":"TEXT","id":"","nodes":[],"textData":{"text":" ","decorations":[]}}],"paragraphData":{"textStyle":{"textAlignment":"AUTO"},"indentation":0}},{"type":"PARAGRAPH","id":"bntlj","nodes":[{"type":"TEXT","id":"","nodes":[],"textData":{"text":" ","decorations":[]}}],"paragraphData":{"textStyle":{"textAlignment":"AUTO"},"indentation":0}},{"type":"IMAGE","id":"5mq1c","nodes":[],"imageData":{"containerData":{"width":{"size":"CONTENT"},"alignment":"CENTER","textWrap":true},"image":{"src":{"id":"577c92_fe907c59107d45c2a95bec3fac82348a~mv2_d_4128_2322_s_2.jpg"},"width":4128,"height":2322},"altText":""}},{"type":"PARAGRAPH","id":"9k59c","nodes":[{"type":"TEXT","id":"","nodes":[],"textData":{"text":" ","decorations":[{"type":"LINK","linkData":{"link":{"url":"www.yelp.com/biz/yami-sushi-and-teriyaki-gresham","target":"BLANK"}}}]}}],"paragraphData":{"textStyle":{"textAlignment":"AUTO"},"indentation":0}},{"type":"PARAGRAPH","id":"edbmo","nodes":[{"type":"TEXT","id":"","nodes":[],"textData":{"text":"We did have to make a stop on the way back at Home Depot to pick up a couple of new door locks to deal with some door lock issues at our friend's house across the street. That felt a little out of balance.","decorations":[]}}],"paragraphData":{"textStyle":{"textAlignment":"AUTO"},"indentation":0}},{"type":"PARAGRAPH","id":"fg7ot","nodes":[{"type":"TEXT","id":"","nodes":[],"textData":{"text":" ","decorations":[]}}],"paragraphData":{"textStyle":{"textAlignment":"AUTO"},"indentation":0}},{"type":"PARAGRAPH","id":"2dfse","nodes":[{"type":"TEXT","id":"","nodes":[],"textData":{"text":" ","decorations":[]}}],"paragraphData":{"textStyle":{"textAlignment":"AUTO"},"indentation":0}},{"type":"PARAGRAPH","id":"flaim","nodes":[{"type":"TEXT","id":"","nodes":[],"textData":{"text":"Then our youngest daughter and her husband came out to visit for the weekend and that was great! They helped me clean out a couple of my flower and veggie gardens that were in terrible need of weeding and mulching since I hadn't gotten too it because you guessed it.","decorations":[]}}],"paragraphData":{"textStyle":{"textAlignment":"AUTO"},"indentation":0}},{"type":"PARAGRAPH","id":"2roch","nodes":[{"type":"TEXT","id":"","nodes":[],"textData":{"text":" ","decorations":[]}}],"paragraphData":{"textStyle":{"textAlignment":"AUTO"},"indentation":0}},{"type":"PARAGRAPH","id":"a4cui","nodes":[{"type":"TEXT","id":"","nodes":[],"textData":{"text":"Life was out of balance.","decorations":[]}}],"paragraphData":{"textStyle":{"textAlignment":"AUTO"},"indentation":0}},{"type":"PARAGRAPH","id":"5fqsl","nodes":[{"type":"TEXT","id":"","nodes":[],"textData":{"text":" ","decorations":[]}}],"paragraphData":{"textStyle":{"textAlignment":"AUTO"},"indentation":0}},{"type":"PARAGRAPH","id":"dgcm8","nodes":[{"type":"TEXT","id":"","nodes":[],"textData":{"text":" ","decorations":[]}}],"paragraphData":{"textStyle":{"textAlignment":"AUTO"},"indentation":0}},{"type":"PARAGRAPH","id":"7cc1b","nodes":[{"type":"TEXT","id":"","nodes":[],"textData":{"text":"We had this fabulous dinner! Sure wish I had taken pictures! But life was out of balance.....","decorations":[]}}],"paragraphData":{"textStyle":{"textAlignment":"AUTO"},"indentation":0}},{"type":"PARAGRAPH","id":"cojuo","nodes":[{"type":"TEXT","id":"","nodes":[],"textData":{"text":" ","decorations":[]}}],"paragraphData":{"textStyle":{"textAlignment":"AUTO"},"indentation":0}},{"type":"PARAGRAPH","id":"dcvkl","nodes":[{"type":"TEXT","id":"","nodes":[],"textData":{"text":" ","decorations":[]}}],"paragraphData":{"textStyle":{"textAlignment":"AUTO"},"indentation":0}},{"type":"PARAGRAPH","id":"dr2sp","nodes":[{"type":"TEXT","id":"","nodes":[],"textData":{"text":"I had purchased 2 whole fish at Fubonn in Portland the day before and we baked them whole encrusted in salt. It is an awesome way to bake fish! I will definitely add it to ","decorations":[]}},{"type":"TEXT","id":"","nodes":[],"textData":{"text":"The Glass Pantry","decorations":[{"type":"BOLD","fontWeightValue":700},{"type":"COLOR","colorData":{"foreground":"#213f95"}},{"type":"LINK","linkData":{"link":{"url":"https://www.theglasspantry.com/home","target":"BLANK"}}}]}},{"type":"TEXT","id":"","nodes":[],"textData":{"text":" when I do it again. The recipe is very simple:","decorations":[]}}],"paragraphData":{"textStyle":{"textAlignment":"AUTO"},"indentation":0}},{"type":"PARAGRAPH","id":"corqd","nodes":[{"type":"TEXT","id":"","nodes":[],"textData":{"text":" ","decorations":[]}}],"paragraphData":{"textStyle":{"textAlignment":"AUTO"},"indentation":0}},{"type":"PARAGRAPH","id":"2cba2","nodes":[{"type":"TEXT","id":"","nodes":[],"textData":{"text":"\n","decorations":[]}}],"paragraphData":{"textStyle":{"textAlignment":"AUTO"},"indentation":0}},{"type":"PARAGRAPH","id":"4tku6","nodes":[{"type":"TEXT","id":"","nodes":[],"textData":{"text":"Salt Encrusted Baked Whole Fish ","decorations":[{"type":"BOLD","fontWeightValue":700},{"type":"COLOR","colorData":{"foreground":"#0957a2"}},{"type":"ITALIC","italicData":true},{"type":"LINK","linkData":{"link":{"url":"www.theglasspantry.com/single-post/2017/11/25/salt-baked-whole-fish","target":"SELF"}}}]}}],"paragraphData":{"textStyle":{"textAlignment":"AUTO"},"indentation":0}},{"type":"PARAGRAPH","id":"c6rj","nodes":[{"type":"TEXT","id":"","nodes":[],"textData":{"text":"(Click on the title for the blog on baking a whole fish encrusted in salt)","decorations":[]}}],"paragraphData":{"textStyle":{"textAlignment":"AUTO"},"indentation":0}},{"type":"PARAGRAPH","id":"do18","nodes":[{"type":"TEXT","id":"","nodes":[],"textData":{"text":" ","decorations":[]}}],"paragraphData":{"textStyle":{"textAlignment":"AUTO"},"indentation":0}},{"type":"PARAGRAPH","id":"ct5qt","nodes":[{"type":"TEXT","id":"","nodes":[],"textData":{"text":"Clean or buy a 2-3 lb. whole fish leaving the head and tail on. No need to scale the fish.","decorations":[]}}],"paragraphData":{"textStyle":{"textAlignment":"AUTO"},"indentation":0}},{"type":"PARAGRAPH","id":"42ub4","nodes":[{"type":"TEXT","id":"","nodes":[],"textData":{"text":" ","decorations":[]}}],"paragraphData":{"textStyle":{"textAlignment":"AUTO"},"indentation":0}},{"type":"PARAGRAPH","id":"8ne9l","nodes":[{"type":"TEXT","id":"","nodes":[],"textData":{"text":"Mix together 2-3 cups of salt with a few egg whites and a couple of tablespoons of water until you get a wet sand consistency.","decorations":[]}}],"paragraphData":{"textStyle":{"textAlignment":"AUTO"},"indentation":0}},{"type":"PARAGRAPH","id":"12s71","nodes":[{"type":"TEXT","id":"","nodes":[],"textData":{"text":" ","decorations":[]}}],"paragraphData":{"textStyle":{"textAlignment":"AUTO"},"indentation":0}},{"type":"PARAGRAPH","id":"lgep","nodes":[{"type":"TEXT","id":"","nodes":[],"textData":{"text":" ","decorations":[]}}],"paragraphData":{"textStyle":{"textAlignment":"AUTO"},"indentation":0}},{"type":"PARAGRAPH","id":"49mk8","nodes":[{"type":"TEXT","id":"","nodes":[],"textData":{"text":"Salt and pepper the cavity of the fish then stuff the fish with a few slices of lemon and some fresh herbs, I used some oregano from my garden.","decorations":[]}}],"paragraphData":{"textStyle":{"textAlignment":"AUTO"},"indentation":0}},{"type":"PARAGRAPH","id":"71nq","nodes":[{"type":"TEXT","id":"","nodes":[],"textData":{"text":" ","decorations":[]}}],"paragraphData":{"textStyle":{"textAlignment":"AUTO"},"indentation":0}},{"type":"PARAGRAPH","id":"bl84t","nodes":[{"type":"TEXT","id":"","nodes":[],"textData":{"text":" ","decorations":[]}}],"paragraphData":{"textStyle":{"textAlignment":"AUTO"},"indentation":0}},{"type":"PARAGRAPH","id":"147ev","nodes":[{"type":"TEXT","id":"","nodes":[],"textData":{"text":"Place a layer of the salt mixture on a sheet pan just large enough to lay the fish on.","decorations":[]}}],"paragraphData":{"textStyle":{"textAlignment":"AUTO"},"indentation":0}},{"type":"PARAGRAPH","id":"anfno","nodes":[{"type":"TEXT","id":"","nodes":[],"textData":{"text":"Place your fish on the salt and then pile the rest of the salt on top of the fish smoothing it out to completely cover the fish and seal the edges so the fish is entirely encased in the salt. It will harden as it bakes and seal in the moisture steaming the fish inside.","decorations":[]}}],"paragraphData":{"textStyle":{"textAlignment":"AUTO"},"indentation":0}},{"type":"PARAGRAPH","id":"banq4","nodes":[{"type":"TEXT","id":"","nodes":[],"textData":{"text":" ","decorations":[]}}],"paragraphData":{"textStyle":{"textAlignment":"AUTO"},"indentation":0}},{"type":"PARAGRAPH","id":"13kqq","nodes":[{"type":"TEXT","id":"","nodes":[],"textData":{"text":" ","decorations":[]}}],"paragraphData":{"textStyle":{"textAlignment":"AUTO"},"indentation":0}},{"type":"PARAGRAPH","id":"rggi","nodes":[{"type":"TEXT","id":"","nodes":[],"textData":{"text":"Bake in the oven at 400 degrees for 40 minutes, then remove the pan from the oven and let the fish rest for another 10 minutes.","decorations":[]}}],"paragraphData":{"textStyle":{"textAlignment":"AUTO"},"indentation":0}},{"type":"PARAGRAPH","id":"ei0d0","nodes":[{"type":"TEXT","id":"","nodes":[],"textData":{"text":" ","decorations":[]}}],"paragraphData":{"textStyle":{"textAlignment":"AUTO"},"indentation":0}},{"type":"PARAGRAPH","id":"6rjs6","nodes":[{"type":"TEXT","id":"","nodes":[],"textData":{"text":" ","decorations":[]}}],"paragraphData":{"textStyle":{"textAlignment":"AUTO"},"indentation":0}},{"type":"PARAGRAPH","id":"afi04","nodes":[{"type":"TEXT","id":"","nodes":[],"textData":{"text":"When you are ready to serve, use a knife to crack a line down the spine of the fish and pry up the hardened shell of salt that should lift right off the fish much more cleanly than you might imagine. brush away any excess salt from the top of the fish.","decorations":[]}}],"paragraphData":{"textStyle":{"textAlignment":"AUTO"},"indentation":0}},{"type":"PARAGRAPH","id":"9func","nodes":[{"type":"TEXT","id":"","nodes":[],"textData":{"text":" ","decorations":[]}}],"paragraphData":{"textStyle":{"textAlignment":"AUTO"},"indentation":0}},{"type":"PARAGRAPH","id":"54dak","nodes":[{"type":"TEXT","id":"","nodes":[],"textData":{"text":" ","decorations":[]}}],"paragraphData":{"textStyle":{"textAlignment":"AUTO"},"indentation":0}},{"type":"PARAGRAPH","id":"a8uns","nodes":[{"type":"TEXT","id":"","nodes":[],"textData":{"text":"Cut just through the skin in a line across the fish behind the gills and peel back the skin to expose the perfectly steamed, moist flesh. This is traditionally served plated just like this, whole with top skin removed, family style. Fish cooked on the bone like this is more flavorful than when cooked as a filet. ","decorations":[]}}],"paragraphData":{"textStyle":{"textAlignment":"AUTO"},"indentation":0}},{"type":"PARAGRAPH","id":"d8amc","nodes":[{"type":"TEXT","id":"","nodes":[],"textData":{"text":" ","decorations":[]}}],"paragraphData":{"textStyle":{"textAlignment":"AUTO"},"indentation":0}},{"type":"